        "text_pLAMYY": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>We built GiftMira for the moment after the wrapping paper hits the floor.</h2><p>You know the one. The pause. The wide eyes. The <em>\"How did you know?\"</em></p><p>That moment is rare. Most gifts don't get there — not because the giver didn't care, but because finding something truly right is genuinely hard. Amazon returns 10,000 results. Most of them are forgettable.</p><p>GiftMira exists to fix that.</p><h2>What we do differently</h2><p>We don't list everything. We list what's worth giving. Every product in our store has been evaluated on one question: <strong>will this make someone say \"how did you know?\"</strong></p><p>That means products with a story. Products that feel specific, not generic. Products that work for the person who has everything — because they've never seen this before.</p><h2>Built for the thoughtful gift-giver</h2><p>Our customer isn't looking for the cheapest option. They're looking for the <em>right</em> option — and they're willing to search for it. We've done the searching for you.</p><p>Whether it's a birthday, Father's Day, graduation, or a Tuesday that calls for something special — GiftMira has a gift worth giving.</p><h2>Our promise</h2><ul><li><strong>Free shipping on every order.</strong> No minimum. No fine print.</li><li><strong>30-day returns.</strong> Love it or we'll make it right — no questions asked.</li><li><strong>Real reviews.</strong> Every rating is from a verified customer.</li><li><strong>Fast support.</strong> Questions? We reply within 24 hours.</li></ul><h2>Say hello</h2><p>We'd love to hear from you — whether it's a question, a gift recommendation request, or just to share a reaction you got after giving one of our products.</p><p>Email us: <a href=\"mailto:hello@giftmira.com\">hello@giftmira.com</a></p><p><em>— Mira at GiftMira</em></p>"
          }
        }
